    <tags>rigcheckpro diagnostics stress-test burnin benchmark hardware repair technician</tags>
    <summary>Plain-English PC diagnostics, Detective Mode, stress tests &amp; branded PDF certs.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[Find out why a PC is slow, overheating, crashing, or restarting — with Detective Mode, Ask RigCheck, self-checking stress tests, and branded customer PDF certificates.

Detective Mode & Ask RigCheck: Pick what's wrong (like 'My PC is slow') or type your own question — RigCheck Pro investigates locally and gives you the likely cause in plain English, with a confidence score, real evidence, and clear next steps. Self-Checking Stress & Burn-In Tests: Run 1-minute checks or sustained burn-in tests on the CPU, graphics card, graphics memory (VRAM), and RAM. Every test checks its own results for errors and stops automatically if a part gets too hot. Branded Customer PDF Certificates: Export a clean, one-page diagnostic certificate and full PDF/CSV report featuring your own shop name and logo — ideal for PC repair workshops, system builders, and used-PC buyers or sellers. 0-100 PC Health Score & Before/After Proof: Clear scores for Cooling, Storage, Memory, and Upgrade Readiness, plus a health timeline and Before/After comparisons to prove a repair or upgrade worked.

Licensing: RigCheck Pro is commercial software and requires a paid license key (£9.99 one-time purchase for 1 PC at a time, personal & commercial use included, 1 year of free updates included — keeps working forever after 1 year with optional £4.99/year updates only if wanted, no auto-renewal, online activation and 14-day periodic licence check required; no free trial and no recurring subscription). Purchase at https://razorlinestudios.co.uk/app.php?slug=rigcheckpro.]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://razorlinestudios.co.uk/app.php?slug=rigcheckpro</releaseNotes>
